[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0010","text":"嗯～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0020","text":"小透——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0030","text":"啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0040","text":"好────\n茄子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0050","text":"要拍呢\n相机"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0060","text":"别看我这样，和相机君可是老交情了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0070","text":"哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0080","text":"你看，制作人不是……\n在准备企划展什么的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0090","text":"虽然还不知道具体内容，但如果有机会的话\n能不能把三峰的照片也一起展示一下呢——之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0100","text":"是偶像本人的作品吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_9998","text":"企划策划人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0110","text":"既然是难得的企划展。我觉得大家亲手创作的作品\n如果能一起陈列出来，粉丝们会更高兴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0120","text":"以“呈现前所未见的姿态”为概念\n希望能推出大家全新的魅力"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0130","text":"────非常感谢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0140","text":"『……过于尊重他人，就会迷失自我吧\n　体谅之心，平衡至关重要』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0150","text":"……上面是这么说的哦，摩美美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0160","text":"呵呵，怎么样呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0170","text":"唔……！\n那句话，也扎到我了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0180","text":"占卜终究只是占卜\n智代子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0190","text":"但是，很难啊……\n这种事情，毕竟牵扯到对方……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0200","text":"嗯——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0210","text":"…………绘画比赛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_9999","text":"阳希"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0220","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0230","text":"我说啊，冬优子酱\n动画主角，是什么样的感觉？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0240","text":"是什么来着…………先配，音……那种？\n跟普通的不一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0250","text":"……是预录音。先录制好台词，\n之后再配合声音进行作画的手法"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0260","text":"因为导演说这样更容易想象，\n所以就先录了演技，才采用了这种方式"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0270","text":"好厉害～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0280","text":"嗯————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0024","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0290","text":"……你从刚才开始，在干什么呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0300","text":"像这样……\n不觉得能用手抓住吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0310","text":"会吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0320","text":"就像超大的天文馆一样\n好多小星星贴在天花板上的感觉！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0330","text":"那翅膀的颜色，是你真正的颜色吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0026","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0340","text":"怎么可能够得到\n你以为有多远啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0027","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0350","text":"好了，差不多该回去了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0028","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0029","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_01_0360","text":"够不到的东西，就是够不到的"}]
